deduplicateCollectionCandidates zeroed BaseScore and rankCandidates scored
only from ChannelRank, so relevance_score was a pure function of position
and identical for matching and garbage queries (DM-GAP-090). Preserve
BaseScore and per-channel ranks, drop zero-similarity candidates instead of
assigning a default rank, and add the absolute BaseScore to the fused score.
